Package: vayuayan
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Air Quality Data Analysis for India
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", , "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mahesh Kumar", "Prajapat", , "22b0433@iitb.ac.in", role = "aut"),
    person("Darakhshan", "Nehal", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Fetch and analyze air quality data from multiple sources including
    CPCB (Central Pollution Control Board) India, OAQ (Open Air Quality platform),
    and WUSTL ACAG satellite PM2.5 data. Provides functions for historical and
    real-time AQI monitoring, geospatial station location services, and satellite
    PM2.5 data processing.
